WEBVTT

00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:08.340
Hey, hey. You all are blocking me, so step aside.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:10.320
Cake Grand Prix?

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.690
I see.

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.790
It is already that time of year.

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.840
closed captions

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:17.550
The winning group can go to France and study.

00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:20.760
If I can go there, I will be able to meet Henri-sensei again.

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:22.700
I also want to win.

00:00:22.700 --> 00:00:26.550
I understand your enthusiasm but it's going to be a very rocky road ahead.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.330
It's a win or lose for the middle school groups.

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:36.280
First, you have to keep winning and winning against the other competitors, you know?

00:00:38.740 --> 00:00:42.460
Then after you finally have become the Cake Grand Prix middle school champion,

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:46.660
your next rivals will come from the high school competition. It's going to be really tough.

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.550
That many?

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:54.330
To be able to see so many sweets... It's awesome!

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.080
As expected from Ichigo-chan.

00:00:56.570 --> 00:00:57.280
Ouch...

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.700
It's not the time to say such nonsense.

00:00:59.880 --> 00:01:00.800
Eh?

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:01.780
Not 'eh?'

00:01:01.780 --> 00:01:03.520
It's special training, you know, special training.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:05.450
There's still 15 days before the Grand Prix.

00:01:05.450 --> 00:01:08.500
You have to properly build up your basics during then.

00:01:10.390 --> 00:01:10.990
Of course.

00:01:11.510 --> 00:01:13.170
We will help too.

00:01:13.610 --> 00:01:14.870
B-But...

00:01:16.090 --> 00:01:17.380
Rumi-san!!!

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.940
Ichigo-chan, do your best!

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:30.100
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:30.100
