00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.880
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.880
#Wasurenai@irc.rizon.net

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:58.290
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:03.160
Alright, are you prepared?

00:03:04.620 --> 00:03:06.120
Why do I have to wear this?

00:03:06.650 --> 00:03:08.690
The basics of the pâtissière is body training.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:10.770
Body training?

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:14.330
Amano, I want you to excerise according to this plan everyday.

00:03:14.740 --> 00:03:16.720
Push-ups, 50 times morning and evening.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:18.780
Sit ups, 50 times morning and evening.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:21.470
Running, one round around the academy morning and evening.

00:03:22.550 --> 00:03:23.920
So much?

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:25.310
And I have to do this everyday?

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.510
No, that's impossible.

00:03:26.970 --> 00:03:28.550
It's not the time to say it's impossible!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.450
So, get to your exercises!

00:03:31.450 --> 00:03:32.260
Yes!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.260
Push yourself up faster!

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:41.490
Kashino, you're a devil.

00:03:49.570 --> 00:03:50.500
Okay, you're done.

00:03:51.970 --> 00:03:54.360
I can't do anymore. I'm at my limits.

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:55.240
Are you alright?

00:03:56.840 --> 00:03:57.580
Thanks.

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.760
Come, let's go.

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:01.220
Go? Where?

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.540
Of course, it's to the next special training.

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:06.630
Science classroom

00:04:07.060 --> 00:04:08.690
Why do I have to wear this?

00:04:09.150 --> 00:04:10.000
Don't you know?

00:04:10.950 --> 00:04:13.580
It's to learn the science behind making delicious sweets.

00:04:14.340 --> 00:04:15.560
It's invaluable.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.700
Even the firmness of the mousse and the rising of batter are governed by the laws of chemistry, right?

00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.480
I'll teach you everything thoroughly, alright?

00:04:24.550 --> 00:04:27.430
After body training, it's chemistry experimenting, huh...

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:30.400
No, no, Ichigo-chan. It's not just those.

00:04:30.920 --> 00:04:31.980
Hanabusa-kun?

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.920
After the experiment finishes, my french language lessons are waiting for you, okay?

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:38.350
French, too?

00:04:38.910 --> 00:04:40.960
I have to do so many trainings?

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:41.580
Oui.

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:42.480
Of course.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:43.720
All of them are the basics.

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:47.430
You want to win and go to France, right?

00:04:48.540 --> 00:04:49.440
I want to go!

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.210
Then, properly follow up with our special training.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:53.110
Roger!

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.940
O-O-Ouch.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:58.730
Geez, it's really tiring.

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:02.070
I wonder if I have to continue to do this training everyday...

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:03.620
Good work!

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.570
I will help you to massage a bit!

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:08.390
It tickles!

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:15.120
recipe 14

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:15.120
Climax<i>!</i>  Cake Grand Prix

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.370
Climax! Cake Grand Prix.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.880
Guess I have to do them...

00:05:23.310 --> 00:05:25.520
Push ups, 50 times, start!

00:05:25.520 --> 00:05:27.440
1...

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:28.890
2...

00:05:29.880 --> 00:05:31.680
It's a refreshing morning.

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.420
We will have some desserts for breakfast.

00:05:34.910 --> 00:05:35.740
Eh?

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:36.600
What happened?

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:41.310
Amano-san...

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:43.060
Please look at these.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.220
There are so many entries for the middle school tournament.

00:05:47.220 --> 00:05:48.700
It's going to be tough on us.

00:05:49.110 --> 00:05:51.010
These are the screened group list.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:53.180
Let's select them starting from those groups with good grades.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.200
Stop!

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.210
This time it's too much!

00:05:57.210 --> 00:05:58.730
See for yourself how much is actually needed.

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:02.700
Question.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.800
What is the temperature used to melt the chocolate?

00:06:05.560 --> 00:06:07.450
Not higher than 60°C.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:08.710
Then, how about white chocolate?

00:06:09.110 --> 00:06:11.070
E-Eh? Umm...

00:06:11.730 --> 00:06:14.700
Didn't I say it's between 35 to 40°C!?

00:06:14.700 --> 00:06:16.740
I will write it on you forehead to stop you from forgetting.

00:06:17.930 --> 00:06:19.050
You're horrible.

00:06:19.050 --> 00:06:20.900
Kashino, you devil! Meanie!

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:22.680
Did you say something?

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:28.350
If that's so, you can go run outside with that branded head of yours.

00:06:29.690 --> 00:06:30.610
Listen well, Amano.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:34.640
Finish up the chocolate cakes and tarts before the night falls.

00:06:35.100 --> 00:06:36.410
Devil!

00:06:37.620 --> 00:06:38.400
How beautiful.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.090
It's not that...

00:06:40.090 --> 00:06:42.500
It's a beauty that can overcome a flower's.

00:06:42.810 --> 00:06:44.490
I'm a genius.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.890
Oh, you're talking about yours.

00:06:46.270 --> 00:06:48.220
Hey, how about mine?

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:51.580
It feels the same as a toliet paper flower.

00:06:51.580 --> 00:06:52.720
Paper...

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:57.560
Hanabusa's opinions is really harsh.

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:58.850
But it's alright.

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:03.110
As long as Ichigo-chan makes a thousand of them, she would definitely be able to do better.

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:04.820
A thousand...

00:07:06.570 --> 00:07:07.560
Take a look at these.

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.780
This one is made with egg whites and yolks beaten together and the other one is separately beaten.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:14.070
Even though the soufflés are made from the same ingredients, the taste and texture are completely different.

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:18.220
You're right.

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:20.560
The one beaten separately tastes really fuffy,

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.370
while the one beaten together tastes really firm.

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:26.420
Only when you understand everything about the eggs and other ingredients,

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:28.630
then can you make delicious sweets.

00:07:28.630 --> 00:07:30.330
You've really enlightened me.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:35.030
Somehow, Andou-kun's teaching method is really gentle and well-mannered.

00:07:35.600 --> 00:07:39.960
Then, the next experiment will be the time it takes to mix butter in a bowl.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:44.480
After that, it will be oven temperatures and methods of baking.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:47.930
And we should also test the differences of using the upper and the lower iron tray.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.940
T-That many?

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:52.990
Experiments you know, it really fires me up.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:56.460
I should say, you are just too focused on success.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:59.830
Andou-kun is more obsessive than I thought.

00:08:05.270 --> 00:08:09.050
Ichigo is always saying "Devil! Devil!" in her sleep.

00:08:09.260 --> 00:08:10.570
It's really scary.

00:08:10.570 --> 00:08:13.120
Of course, it's a pretty hard training for her.

00:08:13.120 --> 00:08:16.090
It's going to be troublesome if she falls asleep just like that.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:17.910
Hey, Amano.

00:08:18.480 --> 00:08:19.930
Hurry up and eat.

00:08:19.930 --> 00:08:21.330
It's almost time to practicing tempering.

00:08:21.920 --> 00:08:22.870
Yes!

00:08:23.380 --> 00:08:25.060
The devil calls.

00:08:27.030 --> 00:08:28.140
Tempering.

00:08:29.760 --> 00:08:30.750
Crafting sweets.

00:08:32.720 --> 00:08:33.920
Cooking experiments.

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:41.340
You worked from the whole day without resting again today.

00:08:41.340 --> 00:08:44.580
Yeah, but I still have to go out.

00:08:44.820 --> 00:08:47.250
Eh? But it's already this late.

00:08:47.250 --> 00:08:49.130
Do you still have more training to do?

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.880
No, it's self-training.

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:54.460
Andou-kun and the other gave me the recipe for making mousse just now.

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:57.080
I thought I should practice it again before I sleep.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:58.680
Then, I'm going.

00:08:58.920 --> 00:09:00.520
Ichigo, you're really admirable.

00:09:01.070 --> 00:09:04.960
Alright. I should go too and support her.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:11.700
Oh no.

00:09:12.260 --> 00:09:14.730
I left my recipe notes in my room.

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:16.900
But I just practiced it awhile ago.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:18.370
I should be doing fine with that.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:22.280
First I should increase the amount of gelatin.

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:27.790
For gelatin, I forgot how much amount of water I should add.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:32.950
Geez, I just practiced it, but I couldn't remember anything at all.

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.880
How can I not know such a basic thing.

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:37.910
Cake Grand Prix.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:43.890
I'm doing my best on my special training everyday, but I wonder if I'm actually improving.

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.500
There is 3 days before the Cake Grand Prix.

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:51.730
If this continues, it's impossible to win continuously in the middle school tournament.

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.960
Go go, Ichigo.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:12.960
Do your best, do your best, Ichigo.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.510
Ichigo, I brought you some fans to support you.

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:22.970
I'm not here to support you but only
to check you so you aren't slacking off.

00:10:23.210 --> 00:10:26.890
You know, I'm very well-versed with caramel related stuff.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:30.250
I will teach them to you, starting from the method to make caramel.

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:32.440
Leave the coffee stuff to me.

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:36.470
Do you want me to show how you make a mocha roll cake?

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.010
What are you saying!?

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:40.700
The royal road of sweets is definitely through chocolates.

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:46.370
If you beg me, I might consider teaching
you how to make a truffle probably.

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:47.750
Hey, hey, Ichigo.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.610
Where do you want us to start teaching from?

00:10:50.240 --> 00:10:51.540
It won't help me!

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.260
Eh?

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:55.480
I can't remember everything in such a short time.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:58.210
So even if you teach me, I will forget about them very quickly.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:03.430
Because I'm not like genius like Tennouji-san and Kashino and the others.

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:05.280
Oh, are you worried about that?

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:06.950
Ichigo, come over here for a moment.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:12.640
Look.

00:11:14.170 --> 00:11:16.440
Tennouji-san who is regarded as a genius.

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.960
She's training like that everyday.

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:30.460
Amano-san.

00:11:33.300 --> 00:11:34.540
Do you have anything to ask me?

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:35.870
No.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:41.070
Come to think of it, you've always been practicing running lately.

00:11:41.610 --> 00:11:42.520
Yes.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.870
You're admirable.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:46.220
The world of the pâtissières is actually a competition of endurance.

00:11:46.220 --> 00:11:49.200
If a girl wants to aim to be a top-class pâtissière,

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:52.650
then she needs to put more effort than the guys on her enduance.

00:11:52.650 --> 00:11:54.850
That is what Henri-sensei taught me.

00:11:55.190 --> 00:11:56.660
Henri-sensei did?

00:11:56.660 --> 00:11:58.860
Amano-san, can you let me see your hands?

00:12:02.180 --> 00:12:03.570
You've got calluses all over.

00:12:04.100 --> 00:12:07.270
You got another step closer to the hands of a pâtissière.

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:11.350
For this upcoming Cake Grand Prix, I decided to participate in it myself.

00:12:11.350 --> 00:12:13.300
Eh? Tennouji-san too?

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:18.500
Things like confrontation between me and you might happen.

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:21.550
The confrontation between Tennouji-san and me.

00:12:22.940 --> 00:12:26.180
Amano-san, you must do your best to get into the finals.

00:12:26.180 --> 00:12:27.050
I will wait for you.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:28.870
Yes, I will do my best!

00:12:29.430 --> 00:12:32.970
I'm still doing my self-training, so I'll excuse myself for now.

00:12:33.920 --> 00:12:35.560
Wait for me, Ichigo!

00:12:36.220 --> 00:12:37.870
The Cake Grand Prix this time.

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:40.590
It seems it'll be very interesting.

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:45.600
I'm going.

00:12:45.600 --> 00:12:46.690
What!?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:49.540
Hanabusa-kun.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.240
How's this?

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:53.240
They really look like roses, Ichigo-chan.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.750
You did well. Bravo.

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:58.430
I made this kind of a mousse.

00:12:58.750 --> 00:12:59.470
See!

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.990
Amazing, Amano-san!

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:01.860
You're good!

00:13:04.060 --> 00:13:09.260
For Henri-sensei who enrolled me in this school and allowed me to polish my talents,

00:13:09.970 --> 00:13:12.690
I will do my utmost best in the Cake Grand Prix!

00:13:15.240 --> 00:13:16.120
Keep quiet.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.540
From now onwards,

00:13:18.540 --> 00:13:22.570
Middle school Cake Grand Prix will start.

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.070
It finally begins.

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.730
It's really grand.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:31.260
Cake Grand Prix is our school's highest priority event.

00:13:31.260 --> 00:13:33.940
What's with this disastrous first year group?

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:38.130
You all don't have skills and yet you joined the Cake Grand Prix.

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.700
You all are really stubborn.

00:13:39.700 --> 00:13:40.790
You won't win even if you join.

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:42.990
It somehow feels bad, huh...

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:43.620
Yeah.

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:47.960
Well then, I shall explain the important lineup for the Cake Grand Prix.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.690
It'll be different from the previous years.

00:13:50.690 --> 00:13:59.500
This year the top three groups of the middle school tournament will proceed to the final tournament.

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:01.520
Also, another thing.

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:06.260
The entries from the middle school are much more than we expected.

00:14:06.260 --> 00:14:09.790
So we added another entry requirement.

00:14:10.540 --> 00:14:11.370
What do you mean?

00:14:11.770 --> 00:14:16.590
Well then, I'll let Karashima-sensei explain the details.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:19.500
Be quiet.

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:22.870
Right now, we shall begin the preliminary test.

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.150
Preliminary test?

00:14:24.150 --> 00:14:25.380
Right now?

00:14:24.470 --> 00:14:25.380
Nobody told me that!

00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:28.880
Anyone who doesn't want to do it is welcome to withdraw.

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:30.650
Preliminary test, huh?

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.200
It's really unexpected.

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:33.170
What will I do?

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:34.850
I'm getting nervous.

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:36.130
It's alright.

00:14:36.130 --> 00:14:37.960
Since you did so many special trainings.

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:41.390
Besides, we will cover your back on the difficult parts.

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.400
That's right. I have nothing to fear with everyone around.

00:14:50.900 --> 00:14:51.900
What's this?

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.460
We shall begin the preliminary test now.

00:14:55.940 --> 00:14:57.620
This test will be done individually.

00:14:58.070 --> 00:15:00.790
So everyone, please take a queue number from the machine.

00:15:01.340 --> 00:15:03.240
There are 4 questions.

00:15:03.240 --> 00:15:05.930
You will be disqualified if you get even one question wrong.

00:15:05.930 --> 00:15:12.220
Within the group, if even one person gets disqualified, the whole group loses their right to participate.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.460
How can that be?

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.390
You know, Ichigo.

00:15:15.390 --> 00:15:20.760
You see, there is a rule that bans me and the other Spirits from helping you in the test.

00:15:21.300 --> 00:15:22.230
I'm sorry.

00:15:22.610 --> 00:15:26.240
So it's to test the ability of the individual candidates.

00:15:26.240 --> 00:15:31.280
If it's called a test, I would say it's a revision of all the things we've done up till now.

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:35.560
That means that Ichigo-chan will be at a real
disadvantage, because she recently transferred in.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:36.700
What should I do?

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:40.780
Amano, have you grilled through your special training for the 15 days?

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:41.750
Yeah.

00:15:42.200 --> 00:15:44.070
Then, you can definitely overcome it.

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:45.260
That's right.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.890
You have worked really hard.

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:49.140
If you calm down, it'll definitely be alright.

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.590
As long you take care to not to stumble through them, you can definitely pass.

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:55.260
For Amano, that's what we are mostly worried about.

00:15:55.500 --> 00:15:56.450
You're right.

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:59.600
B-But, this is an important test.

00:15:59.600 --> 00:16:02.330
I'll take care not to stumble through them.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:03.770
You all can rest assured about that.

00:16:06.100 --> 00:16:07.280
Number 24.

00:16:08.050 --> 00:16:09.720
Is number 24 here?

00:16:11.130 --> 00:16:12.300
Number 24?

00:16:12.300 --> 00:16:13.600
Ah, it's me!

00:16:13.890 --> 00:16:14.630
I'm here!

00:16:14.630 --> 00:16:16.630
I'm number 24!

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.280
So, I'm going!

00:16:19.390 --> 00:16:20.800
It hurts...

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:22.330
I'm sorry.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.000
I-Is she going to be alright?

00:16:24.000 --> 00:16:25.120
Amano-san...

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:27.840
Somehow, I feel my stomach is aching.

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:31.950
I wonder what this place is.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:35.290
Dessert spotted!

00:16:35.290 --> 00:16:37.030
This means I can eat it, right?

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.130
Lucky me!

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.980
Delicious!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:45.920
To be able to eat desserts before the test. How thoughtful.

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:46.800
Err...

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.980
I should just follow the arrow.

00:16:51.190 --> 00:16:52.350
Butter room.

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:55.230
Question 1.

00:16:55.230 --> 00:16:58.700
What kind of butter was it made from?

00:16:58.980 --> 00:17:03.750
Could it be asking what butter was that pound cake just now made from?

00:17:04.110 --> 00:17:05.070
What should I do?

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:08.090
I thought it was dessert, so I didn't taste it properly.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:09.460
I made a fool out of myself...

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:13.200
For Amano, that's what we are most worried about.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.210
It's vexing!

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:17.880
I will definitely answer it correctly.

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:25.340
A is salted butter.

00:17:25.340 --> 00:17:27.080
B is unsalted butter.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:31.460
C is also the same, unsalted. But this kind of fluffy texture is...

00:17:31.800 --> 00:17:33.080
Cultured unsalted butter.

00:17:33.950 --> 00:17:36.860
Pound cake requires a large amount of butter.

00:17:36.860 --> 00:17:39.080
So using salted butter will make it too salty.

00:17:39.080 --> 00:17:41.040
This means it isn't A.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:43.470
It should be B or C.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:45.060
Which is it?

00:17:45.060 --> 00:17:48.700
The pound cake just now tastes like what?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.220
This tangy taste...

00:17:54.220 --> 00:17:56.940
As I thought, it's C, cultured unsalted butter!

00:17:57.790 --> 00:17:58.920
Thank goodness.

00:17:58.920 --> 00:18:02.100
I used my hands to eat the pound cake.

00:18:02.100 --> 00:18:04.800
I should really thank my bad table manners.

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:08.930
Sugar?

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:13.130
Question 2.

00:18:13.130 --> 00:18:15.940
What kind of sugar was it made from?

00:18:16.700 --> 00:18:18.190
All of them tastes sweet.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:20.970
From the colouring, I think C is brown sugar.

00:18:20.970 --> 00:18:23.450
Looking at the grains of the sugar, A is granulated sugar.

00:18:23.450 --> 00:18:25.790
B is refined white sugar, I believe.

00:18:26.790 --> 00:18:31.310
If I remember, Andou-kun's pound cake uses refined white sugar.

00:18:31.310 --> 00:18:33.760
Besides, he told me it can bake out properly.

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:35.300
So the correct answer is B.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:40.800
Welcome to the all-correct room.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:42.220
Thank goodness.

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:44.860
So, where's Amano-san?

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.340
She hasn't come out.

00:18:46.340 --> 00:18:47.690
It's going to be troublesome.

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:50.230
Could she be knocked out on the question on sugar?

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.060
The correct answer is A, granulated sugar.

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:56.940
Because only granulated sugar is the best one that can retain the butter's taste,

00:18:56.940 --> 00:18:58.590
as well as not be burnt.

00:18:59.100 --> 00:19:04.990
But during the special training, I wanted to make a perfect pound cake, so I used refined white sugar.

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:10.910
Like chocolate which has a lot of dry fats in it,

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:13.830
you should use the light sweetness granulated sugar.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:14.880
Remember this!

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:19.940
Come to think of it, this pound cake is made from cultured butter.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:23.340
If that's the case, the granulated sugar would be better.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:25.220
The correct answer isn't B, it's A.

00:19:29.050 --> 00:19:30.060
Question 3.

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.810
What kind of egg was used in it?

00:19:33.300 --> 00:19:35.710
But you cannot break open the eggs.

00:19:35.710 --> 00:19:38.280
I did this too in Andou-kun's special training.

00:19:38.580 --> 00:19:39.770
Spin it around like this.

00:19:40.530 --> 00:19:43.450
The one which keeps spinning is the boiled egg.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.000
A is out.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:48.450
Which leaves B and C.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:51.890
The appearance and mass are almost the same.

00:19:51.890 --> 00:19:53.160
In this situation,

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.740
Andou-kun taught me before, shining on the egg like this and if the interior is a bit black,

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:59.870
it means the egg has passed its expiry date and is rotten.

00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:01.970
Well then, the correct answer is B.

00:20:02.890 --> 00:20:04.170
Last question.

00:20:04.170 --> 00:20:05.320
The choice of flour.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.800
So I have to choose which one of these is cake flour?

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:13.550
These three are probably hard flour, medium flour, and soft flour used for cakes.

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:15.510
What's the difference?

00:20:15.880 --> 00:20:17.500
The amount of gluten it contains.

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:21.440
Hard, medium, and soft flour has a decreasing amount of gluten, respectively.

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:25.510
The more gluten you have the more elastic the dough, and it will stiffen as you knead it.

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:28.570
Therefore for soft sweets we use soft flour.

00:20:29.130 --> 00:20:30.040
Number 24!

00:20:30.890 --> 00:20:34.640
You have one minute left. If you run out of time you fail.

00:20:34.640 --> 00:20:36.500
Oh no! I only have one minute left!

00:20:37.150 --> 00:20:41.740
The cake flour should have the smallest granules...

00:20:42.120 --> 00:20:43.560
I know that, but...

00:20:44.070 --> 00:20:46.410
I can't tell which one is which in a rush!

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:49.570
Wait... Hard flour... Stiffen...

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:52.010
In that case...

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:59.060
30 seconds left...

00:20:59.870 --> 00:21:02.240
I see, so you'll try kneading them with water.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.590
A stiffened quickly, so it's hard.

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:06.960
B is so-so...

00:21:06.960 --> 00:21:10.090
C is is the lightest, and it's taking a while to come together.

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:13.240
It's C! The least stiff is the cake flour!

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:17.410
Please, let this be the all-correct room!

